<title>USA: Giddings asks holders to wait on tender.</title>
<headline>Giddings asks holders to wait on tender.</headline>
<dateline>FOND DU LAC, Wis. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giddings &amp; Lewis Inc on Friday said it asked its shareholders not to act on a $19-a-share tender offer from Harnischfeger Industries Inc until its board of directors could review the offer and the company's alternatives.</p>
</text>
